[node name="Kit" type="Node3D"]
editor_description = "Kit, Ralph the chandler's daughter, who sells candles at the gate: small, quick, young (her age is mine: a girl of fourteen or so). Fair hair loose to her collar, a tan kirtle and an apron, a basket of candles (tools/build/chr_kit.py). Model is her body on its skeleton, with her clips (PersonModel). Feet at the origin, facing -Z. Head is her face (a FaceRig over the head model); Face is where the conversation camera looks. In the game both ride on the skeleton's head."
